%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-core-functions-xsitype (関数ページ)
doc と相違 (表記のみ: 引用符・括弧・書式の違いで、値は同じ)
doc の Output:
  <?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
   <user xsi:type="acme:user" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:acme="http://acme.com">
       <name>Peter</name>
       <lastName>Parker</lastName>
   </user>
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/xml
ns acme http://acme.com
---
  {
      user @((xsiType("user", acme))): {
          name: "Peter",
          lastName: "Parker"
      }
  }
%%% output application/xml
<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<user xmlns:acme="http://acme.com" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:type="acme:user">
  <name>Peter</name>
  <lastName>Parker</lastName>
</user>
